 Cut, and a $6 Billion Buyback","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOSzdOWEJHcmJxSzRSblJSeXZZWXdBVGNGNHZaQ0JCQTdPSVVOWl8tUkJQN3dJcmVSYUV6dFJjczNBckR1NmZsMXRzZFdxVDZzUHJxM041OGNOZnlSbWtDa2RNWGNtaTI4OFJTeHAyTHpfWmxnZ3pxbU9FeERreVJBUFNrMGc1UQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"CRH 2026 年第三季：每股盈餘成長、指引下修與 60 億美元回購"},{"title":"CRH plc Updates Earnings Guidance for the Fiscal Year 2026","src":"marketscreener.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQRTk4Mk9abmpNNm81UTZjcEV4VUhVRU1LamZnUVJ0SXZCUUtkNTYyRG9aZnJuSlpVOXQ0M1pDUVJxcWJVaUMzMFZ2S2xWTnFEVWtTaERjem50TEdabWlLR2xOOURwYVZFRXMwY3VMTXRwNGZOQzBObUNobG9DMmhZVEdYNTNtUllkWEg3ZUpGNG1feWxhSUN5MzFiSFk0OTdvT1Jjb29CRzFlbzJfRjAySw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"CRH plc 更新 2026 財年獲利指引"},{"title":"[CRH Q3 2026 Earnings Call] CRH Cuts FY Guidance as Diesel Surge Eclipses $11.4B Revenue; Launches $6B Buyback","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5sRXVRa3pnWWFncUt0M1lyQVd6RUl6R25JZFBEWHppZWh4SUt4N1NjZEY2R1dudGlJU3pveVFjSmlZYm52TFBGOWxoY0p0bEYybm1XVlRlZlo5UE85?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"[CRH 2026 年第 3 季財報電話會議] 由於柴油價格飆升導致 $11.4B 營收黯然失色，CRH 下調了財年指引；啟動 $6B 回購"},{"title":"CRH: FY26 EBITDA guidance is $7.8B-$8.0B; Velocity targets $400M in annual benefits by 2028","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"CRH：26 財政年度 EBITDA 指引為 $7.8B-$8.0B； Velocity 的目標是到 2028 年達到 4 億美元的年度效益"},{"title":"CRH: Revenue grew, EBITDA held steady, and FY26 guidance was cut amid cost and residential headwinds","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"CRH：收入成長，EBITDA 保持穩定，26 財年指導因成本和住宅逆風而下調"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":13},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/849395/000162828026009043/crh-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CRH is the leading provider of building materials critical to modernizing infrastructure. With our team of 83,032 people across 3,961 locations, our unmatched scale, connected portfolio, and deep local relationships make us the partner of choice for transportation, water and reindustrialization projects, shaping communities for a better tomorrow. The Company, which has market leadership positions in North America, Europe and Australia, has grown rapidly since formation in 1970 and in 2025 generated $37.4 billion of Total revenues, $3.8 billion of Net income and $7.7 billion of Adjusted EBITDA*.1","zh":"CRH 是對基礎設施現代化至關重要的建築材料的領先供應商。我們的團隊由 83,032 名員工組成，遍布 3,961 個地點，無與倫比的規模、互聯的產品組合和深厚的當地關係使我們成為交通、水利和再工業化項目的首選合作夥伴，塑造社區，創造更美好的明天。該公司在北美、歐洲和澳洲佔據市場領導地位，自 1970 年成立以來發展迅速，到 2025 年實現了 374 億美元的總收入、38 億美元的淨利潤和 77 億美元的調整後 EBITDA*1。"},{"en":"In 2025, 40% of Total revenues came from infrastructure, 32% from residential construction and 28% from non-residential construction. 60% of Total revenues came from sales to new-build construction, while 40% of Total revenues came from repair and remodel activity.","zh":""},{"en":"CRH's connected portfolio supplies building materials across the construction value chain, better serving our customers' needs and driving repeat business while making construction simpler, safer and more sustainable. This customer-centric approach combines our unique entrepreneurial culture, leading performance and local market knowledge with our value-added building products and services to be a valuable partner for customers across our end-markets. CRH's leading positions of scale serve transportation and critical infrastructure, reindustrialization projects and commercial and residential construction activity.","zh":"CRH 的互聯產品組合在整個建築價值鏈中供應建築材料，更好地滿足客戶的需求並推動重複業務，同時使建築更簡單、更安全和更永續。這種以客戶為中心的方法將我們獨特的創業文化、領先的業績和本地市場知識與我們的增值建築產品和服務相結合，成為我們終端市場客戶的寶貴合作夥伴。 CRH 的規模領先地位服務於交通運輸和關鍵基礎設施、再工業化項目以及商業和住宅建設活動。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Americas Materials Solutions manufactures and supplies building materials for the construction and maintenance of public and private infrastructure, commercial and industrial applications, and residential buildings in North America. The primary materials produced by this segment include aggregates, cementitious materials, readymixed concrete and asphalt. This segment also provides paving and construction services for customers. In 2025, this segment accounted for 45% of CRH's Total revenues and 52% of Adjusted EBITDA.","zh":"Americas Materials Solutions 生產和供應用於北美公共和私人基礎設施、商業和工業應用以及住宅建築的建造和維護的建築材料。該部門生產的主要材料包括骨材、水泥材料、預拌混凝土和瀝青。該部門也為客戶提供鋪路和施工服務。至2025年，該部門佔CRH總收入的45%和調整後EBITDA的52%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"CRH is a market leader in many of the construction markets it operates in across North America, Europe and Australia. CRH prioritizes investment in markets with attractive fundamentals including population and economic growth, which drive demand for construction. Many of the markets in which CRH operates are highly fragmented, and as a result, CRH products and services face strong competition. The Company's profits are sensitive to changes in volumes and prices which are impacted from time to time by competitive conditions experienced in different markets.","zh":"CRH 是其在北美、歐洲和澳洲營運的許多建築市場的市場領導者。 CRH 優先投資具有有吸引力的基本面的市場，包括人口和經濟成長，從而推動建築需求。 CRH 營運的許多市場高度分散，因此 CRH 產品和服務面臨激烈競爭。公司的利潤對數量和價格的變化很敏感，而數量和價格的變化不時受到不同市場競爭狀況的影響。"},{"en":"Pricing for products is impacted by macroeconomic conditions, the number of competitors, the degree of utilization of production capacity, the specifics of product demand, innovation and differentiation, among other factors.","zh":"產品定價受到宏觀經濟狀況、競爭對手數量、產能利用率、產品需求細節、創新和差異化等因素的影響。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas Materials Solutions","val":17029000000,"zh":"美洲材料解決方案"},{"name":"International Solutions","val":13296000000,"zh":"國際解決方案"},{"name":"Americas Building Solutions","val":7122000000,"zh":"美洲建築解決方案"}],"total":37447000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Road Solutions","val":17089000000,"zh":"道路解決方案"},{"name":"Essential Materials","val":10374000000,"zh":"必備材料"},{"name":"Service","val":8693000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Outdoor Living Solutions","val":5116000000,"zh":"戶外生活解決方案"},{"name":"Building & Infrastructure Solutions","val":4868000000,"zh":"Building & Infrastructure Solutions"}],"total":37447000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":22834000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Rest Of Europe","val":7373000000,"zh":"歐洲其他地區"},{"name":"GB","val":3767000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":3473000000,"zh":"世界其他地區"}],"total":37447000000}},"peers":["MLM","EXP","VMC","JHX","FERG"]}}